<p>Fighting along the Israel-Lebanon border intensified on March 26, with Lebanese officials saying Israeli strikes killed five people and Hezbollah announcing new attacks on Israeli positions. At the same time, the Israeli military said it needs more forces on the Lebanese front because it is operating across several arenas, including Gaza, the West Bank, and Syria, while building what a spokesman described as a forward defensive zone. The escalation is also spilling into diplomacy. Lebanon says it will file a complaint with the UN Security Council over Israeli attacks. The fighting comes as Beirut faces political strain and as questions grow in Israel about how long the military can sustain operations on several fronts at once.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/b4DYFtG8en8wYndfl1Es8RiGj6Br5w6DypGuhSRAEavYHZnEFBatHQLvKS6EpjwRoYHXNjeHFmkCmS4uMT7RqI1iH320KiGycHnVrZu1qIXGRBNnptSN5H0xM298t4_8WIj8qIJe06JYD2Hn-6ijxv0ULeX6ZkCzSM13qPbwZ6VIUl5rAr20u2htwjaj4m8bE5izzKdo37PnRd1fy9ceykEjZiHvmRV-rA5zBba60rQ5Tu-4IMAc9PHG_IKI-Lo' alt='An Israeli artillery unit fires towards Lebanon, amid escalating hostilities between Israel and Hezbollah, northern Israel, March 26, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Street reaction: Demonstrators gathered outside the Iranian embassy in Beirut to show support for Iran after Lebanon moved against the ambassador.</li><li>Command warning: Media reports said military chief Lt. Gen. Eyal Zamir told Israel&#x27;s security cabinet that the IDF was &quot;on the verge of collapse&quot; as operations stretched across multiple fronts.</li><li>Frontline fighting: Video reporting showed Hezbollah resisting advancing Israeli troops.</li></ul><blockquote>The forward defensive zone that we are creating requires additional IDF forces, - an Israeli military spokesman</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Lebanese cabinet: Beirut&#x27;s decision to declare Iran&#x27;s ambassador persona non grata exposed internal divisions, with Hezbollah and Amal ministers boycotting the cabinet session. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/lebanon-complain-security-council-over-israeli-attacks'>Al-Monitor</a>)</li><li>Hezbollah: Naim Qassem said any talks with Israel while attacks continue would amount to &quot;surrender&quot; and urged Lebanese authorities to reverse what he described as efforts to criminalize Hezbollah&#x27;s military activities. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/lebanon-israeli-strikes-hezbollah-news-updates/article70789546.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>Israeli military: A spokesman said the buildup of a new defensive zone in the north is adding to manpower demands on an army already operating in Gaza, the West Bank, and Syria at the same time. (<a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/26/israeli-army-calls-for-more-troops-on-lebanese-front-opposition-warns-shortage-could-trigger-security-disaster_6751845_4.html'>Le Monde</a>)</li><li>Israeli opposition: Opposition figures warned that shortages on the northern front could lead to a wider &quot;security disaster,&quot; arguing that the military is overstretched. (<a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/26/israeli-army-calls-for-more-troops-on-lebanese-front-opposition-warns-shortage-could-trigger-security-disaster_6751845_4.html'>Le Monde</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch'>&#x27;They&#x27;re putting up quite a fight&#x27;: Hezbollah pushes back against Israel&#x27;s advancing troops</a> - youtube.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/26/israeli-army-calls-for-more-troops-on-lebanese-front-opposition-warns-shortage-could-trigger-security-disaster_6751845_4.html'>Israeli army calls for more troops on Lebanese front, opposition warns shortage could trigger &#x27;security disaster&#x27;</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/lebanon-complain-security-council-over-israeli-attacks'>Lebanon to complain to Security Council over Israeli attacks</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/lebanon-israeli-strikes-hezbollah-news-updates/article70789546.ece'>Lebanon says Israeli strikes kill five as Hezbollah claims new attacks</a> - thehindu.com</li></ul>